 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY12-25 OCF $29.9B less capex $28.5B left only **$1.4B FCF**. Dividends **$1.4B**; buybacks **$0.7B**; cash acquisitions **$8.1B**. FCF was negative every year from FY11 to FY18; growth was funded with debt and stock.",
    "zh": "FY12-25 OCF $29.9B 减资本开支 $28.5B，仅得 **FCF $1.4B**。股息 **$1.4B**；回购 **$0.7B**；现金收购 **$8.1B**。FY11-FY18 每年 FCF 为负，增长靠举债和发股。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Diluted shares rose from 150M (FY11) to 616M (FY25), **4.1 times**, mainly from stock-funded deals (Rice 2017, Equitrans 2024). 629M diluted in Q3 2026.",
    "zh": "稀释股数由 FY11 的 150M 增至 FY25 的 616M，**增至 4.1 倍**，主要来自换股收购（2017 年 Rice、2024 年 Equitrans）。2026年Q3 稀释股数 6.29 亿股。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Scale was bought with shares.",
    "zh": "规模是用股票买来的。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Shares grew 4.1x since FY11 while FCF per share has only recently turned positive. Cumulative FY12-25 FCF was just $1.4B against $8.1B of cash acquisitions plus large stock deals. Per-share value, not production growth, is the test from here.",
    "zh": "自 FY11 起股数增至 4.1 倍，而每股 FCF 直到最近才转正。FY12-25 累计 FCF 仅 $1.4B，而现金收购达 $8.1B，另有大额换股收购。今后的检验标准应是每股价值，而不是产量增长。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Now the cash is real.",
    "zh": "现在现金是真实的。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "FY25 OCF $5.1B and FCF $2.8B, the best year on record; TTM FCF $3.8B. Volumes rose 28% in FY21-25 to 2,382 Bcfe while capex stayed near $2.3B.",
    "zh": "FY25 OCF $5.1B、FCF $2.8B，为历史最好；TTM FCF $3.8B。FY21-25 销售量增长 28% 至 2,382 Bcfe，资本开支保持在约 $23 亿。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Owning the pipes changes the cost.",
    "zh": "拥有管道改变了成本。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "After reacquiring Equitrans, most gathering and transmission revenue is internal, so cost per Mcfe fell to $1.09. The trade-off is $3.55B of minority interests and more fixed assets, so ROIC (7.3% in FY25) has to rise as the pipes fill with third-party gas.",
    "zh": "重新收购 Equitrans 后，大部分集输和输气收入变为内部收入，单位成本降至 $1.09/Mcfe。代价是 $35.5 亿的少数股东权益和更多固定资产，因此 ROIC（FY25 为 7.3%）需要随第三方气量增加而提升。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Debt is coming down fast.",
    "zh": "债务在快速下降。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Total debt fell from $9.4B (FY24) to $5.6B (Q3 2026); net debt/EBITDA from 3.7x to 0.8x TTM. Lower leverage matters for a company with a BBB- rating and gas-price exposure; it also leaves room to restart buybacks.",
    "zh": "总债务由 FY24 的 $94 亿降至 2026年Q3 的 $56 亿；净债务/EBITDA 由 3.7 倍降至 TTM 0.8 倍。对评级 BBB-、承担天然气价格风险的公司，降杠杆很重要，也为重启回购留出空间。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Reported revenue swings with hedges.",
    "zh": "报表收入随套保波动。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "GAAP revenue includes derivative results: $7.5B in FY22 against $12.1B of gross sales. Judge the business by volume x realised price and unit cost, not by headline revenue.",
    "zh": "GAAP 收入包含衍生品损益：FY22 为 $75 亿，而毛销售额为 $121 亿。评价业务应看销量 × 实现价格与单位成本，而不是报表收入。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The gas deck decides the value.",
    "zh": "天然气价格决定估值。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $54.40 (WACC 8.5%, g 1.5%, beta 0.9) assumes Henry Hub $3.16 in 2027 rising to $3.50 by 2030 as LNG grows; TV is 76% of EV. At $51.24 that is +6%. Bear $24 and bull $85 show how wide the range is. Morningstar ($67) already includes the Range Resources deal; at its 7.5% WACC my standalone model is worth about $64.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $54.40（WACC 8.5%，g 1.5%，beta 0.9）假设 Henry Hub 由 2027 年的 $3.16 随 LNG 增长升至 2030 年的 $3.50；终值占 EV 76%。按 $51.24 计 +6%。悲观 $24、乐观 $85，区间很宽。Morningstar（$67）已计入收购 Range Resources；按其 7.5% 的 WACC，我的独立模型约 $64。"
   }
  }
 ],
