  "en": [
   "FY11-25 from SEC 10-K XBRL (calendar year). Revenue = GAAP total revenues incl. derivative gains/losses (FY11-15: oil & gas revenue tag). Capex FY11-17 = payments for productive assets (incl. midstream before the 2018 spin).",
   "EBITDA* = operating income + DD&A. FCF = OCF - capex. ROIC* = op. income x (1-21%) / (equity + debt - cash). Dividend/Sh.* = dividends paid / diluted shares. KPI net debt/EBITDA from the analyst model (S&P basis).",
   "Header: Nov 16, 2026 close $51.24, 625.6M shares; book value = Sep 30, 2026 equity $25.5B; TTM P/E (EPS $4.21); P/FCF on TTM FCF $3.8B. FY21-25 P/E, yields and Mkt cap* from StockAnalysis (FY-end).",
   "DCF: Pythia model EQT_DCF_Model, Oct 30, 2026 (price $55.38); WACC 8.5%, g 1.5%. Street avg target = 22-analyst average (S&P Global via StockAnalysis). Morningstar FV $67 (Oct 26, 2026).",
